                                "sense_id": "65a3acbf-a346-34c5-90c2-dc68249d969c",
                                "text": "The agreement may provide for drawdown of the loan within the contract period as and when funds are required by the borrower, which part of the contract period till the last instalment is drawn is also referred to as the 'commitment period'."
